The Go packages ported from NSH are modified: Rust is translated into Go, names
follow Go conventions, and behavior differs where ARCHITECTURE.md records it.
ARCHITECTURE.md's "Code map" names the NSH crate each package comes from.

core/tailwind_palette.go is Tailwind CSS's default palette,
https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss, Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc.,
licensed under the MIT License, converted to sRGB as NSH converts it.

