https://github.com/DioxusLabs/taffy, Copyright (c) 2018 Visly Inc. and
Copyright (c) 2026 Taffy Authors, licensed under the MIT License. That directory's
LICENSE file holds the full text.

The shader compiler in internal/shader and internal/shaderir is Ebitengine's
Kage compiler, https://github.com/hajimehoshi/ebiten, Copyright 2020 The Ebiten
Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as MyGo,
https://github.com/egoist/mygo, Copyright (c) 2026 MyGo contributors, forked
it under the MIT License. Its files keep their notices and say what MyGo
changed; NSGo replaced MyGo's bridge. internal/shader/LICENSE holds both texts.

